{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "t1_c",
  "tier": 1,
  "name": "Security Network C",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 1 gentle start with vertical lanes: the hub is at the top, the exit room at the bottom.",
    "Route A (left): west from the hub, then down with a patrolled loop and an optional conveyor on the long vertical.",
    "Route B (centre): drops straight down, steps east, then runs a long southern stretch with an optional conveyor.",
    "Route C (right): mirror of A with four slots and an ambient robot on the final run that grants T1_MAINT.",
    "Exit trigger is cell [16,29]; one fixed camera in the exit room at [19,30]."
  ],
